1. OVERALL VISUAL CONCEPT:
An ancient parchment cartography world inspired by the Game of Thrones opening credits, featuring aged vellum textures, rusted iron borders, and glowing dragon-amber accents.

2. EXACT COLOR PALETTE & HARMONY ACCENTS:
bg: #1c1510, surface: #2b2219, surface2: #3a2e22, fg: #e6dab8, ink: #f4e2bb, accent: #c47c2b, harmony1: #8a2c14, harmony2: #334d5c, harmony3: #594132

3. TYPOGRAPHY & 4-DIGIT BMP UNICODE HEX SYMBOL:
