4. BASE PAGE CANVAS (html, body):
A deep sepia-brown base gradient transitioning from #1c1510 at the top to #120d0a at the bottom, overlaid with a subtle crosshatch parchment noise texture and faint radial spotlight in warm amber.

5. TOP HEADER BAR & ICON DESIGN ([data-mydes="header"]):
A heavy forged-iron surface gradient from #2b2219 to #1c1510, featuring a bottom decorative trim pattern of repeating castled battlements in #c47c2b, deep drop shadow #000000 0px 4px 12px, and brass-gold icons.

6. SEARCH BOX & FOCUS STATE ([data-mydes="search"]):
An indented parchment slot with background #3a2e22, inset shadow #120d0a 0px 2px 4px inset, bordered by a thin 1px weathered bronze line #c47c2b, placeholder text in muted parchment #b0a386, and a bright dragon-amber focus ring #d4933d.

7. FILTER CHIPS, COLOR CYCLING & SELECTED STATE ([data-mydes="chip"]):
Pill-shaped badges with subtle bevel gradients; every 2nd chip cycles to deep blood-crimson #8a2c14, 3rd chip to sea-strait blue #334d5c, and 4th chip to earthy leather #594132. Active chip lights up with a solid gold-leaf border #c47c2b and glowing text.

8. CARDS, SURFACE TEXTURE, CORNER ORNAMENTS & COLOR CYCLING ([data-mydes="card"]):
Rectangular parchment cards with surface gradient #2b2219 to #231b13, subtle vertical line watermarks, a fine top-edge light-trim of 1px #d4933d, geometric corner brackets in oxidized bronze, with every 2nd card featuring a crimson-tinted border #8a2c14 and 3rd card a deep navy shadow #334d5c.

9. THUMBNAIL IMAGE GRADING & ACTION BUTTONS ([data-mydes="card"] img, [data-mydes="btn"]):
Thumbnails framed with a heavy 2px rusted-iron border #3a2e22 and sepia-toned color grading; action buttons styled as wax-seal circles or embossed bronze plates with warm amber highlights.

10. BOTTOM NAVIGATION BAR ([data-mydes="bottom-bar"]):
A fixed cartographer's desk bar with surface #1c1510 to #2b2219, topped with a repeating compass-rose and jagged-mountain decorative trim line in #c47c2b, housing burnished bronze navigation icons.

