4. UNREADABLE TEXT (`lowContrastText` in Telemetry or Screenshot):
   - For every selector in `lowContrastText` (contrast < 3.2:1), force readable high-contrast `color: var(--m-fg) !important;` (or `var(--m-ink) !important`) and `text-shadow` so every word is crystal clear.
5. LAYOUT PROTECTION:
